WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:03.200
He must intend for me to inherit the throne

00:04.080 --> 00:05.280
So it is

00:05.360 --> 00:07.360
Then I'll become the emperor's brother-in-law

00:08.320 --> 00:09.040
What about me?

00:09.120 --> 00:09.480
Me

00:09.600 --> 00:10.680
You

00:10.760 --> 00:12.160
You'll be General Zhu

00:12.600 --> 00:14.200
Good, good

00:14.880 --> 00:15.760
Leave tonight

00:15.840 --> 00:17.240
Delay invites trouble

00:22.840 --> 00:24.160
Increase that

00:24.240 --> 00:25.640
Grain production

00:26.320 --> 00:27.400
Good

00:27.480 --> 00:29.120
The world will be ours

00:34.480 --> 00:35.880
Thank you, General

00:38.000 --> 00:39.720
You only brought two people back?

00:39.880 --> 00:41.280
What else?

00:41.360 --> 00:43.160
I was afraid I wouldn't have time to find you when I returned

00:43.240 --> 00:44.520
General Chen

00:44.600 --> 00:46.520
I brought you a gift

00:53.880 --> 00:54.800
Xie Xuan

00:54.880 --> 00:56.280
You're asking for death

00:56.360 --> 00:57.880
My brother-in-law's great plan is about to succeed

00:57.960 --> 00:59.640
Not only will I slap you

00:59.720 --> 01:01.720
I'll also kick you to death

01:05.240 --> 01:06.640
Guards

01:10.080 --> 01:11.760
Don't take them to the crown prince

01:11.840 --> 01:13.480
Kill them now

01:14.080 --> 01:16.080
I'd like to see who dares

01:16.880 --> 01:18.280
Bury them alive

01:18.360 --> 01:19.640
Drown them

01:19.720 --> 01:21.960
Chop them up and feed them to dogs
